        "Content": "4 Bed Detached Residence"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Charming and quaint 4 Bedroom Family Home with a most warming and welcoming feel located just 2km from Glandore Village.\r\n\r\nWith about 1,600sqft of space on a mature landscaped plot, this spacious residence portrays a period style throughout and its close proximity to Glandore, Rosscarbery and surrounding coastal amenities makes it a highly desirable property.\r\n\r\nAccommodation on the ground floor is laid out with an entrance porch and hallway, 3 reception rooms, a kitchen/dining room, large utility, guest wc and rear hall / store room. \r\n\r\nThe ground floor features some beautiful decorative plaster work with cornicing and ceiling roses along with a marble fireplace, mahogany joinery, hardwood flooring and an attractive arched opening between the sitting and living rooms. \r\n\r\nThe kitchen is homely and bright with the added benefit of the large utility and store rooms adjoining.\r\n\r\nThe first floor is laid out with 1 single and 3 double bedrooms along with a sizable bathroom.\r\n\r\nExternally the house has a large boiler room/garage and a collection of out-buildings, concrete driveway with rear parking space and lush landscaped gardens with a side patio area.\r\n\r\nThe ever-popular Glandore National School is just a 10 minute walk and Rosscarbery's secondary School just 4km away with school busses passing nearby. \r\n\r\nGlandore's allure continues to outperform its peers resulting from its natural beauty and welcoming community with this turn-key house  firmly positioned to take full advantage.\r\n\r\nServices: Well water, Private Drainage, Electricity, Fiber Broadband, Oil-Heating\r\n\r\nLocation; Glandore 2km, Rosscarbery 4km & Cork City & Airport 70km"
      },
      {
